<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Webinar | Germany 101:</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">A New Destination for</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">International Students</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">July 10, 2025</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Are your students exploring study options beyond the usual destinations? Germany is fast becoming a top choice for international students, boasting world-class education, affordable tuition, and strong career prospects.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-germany-101?&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q2-2025"><strong><u>Join us for an exclusive 60-minutes webinar</u></strong></a></span> on <strong><span style="color: #48b985;">July 10, 2025 at 12:30 PM IST | 2:00 PM ICT | 9:00 AM CEST</span>.</strong>&nbsp;This session will give you the key insights and tools you need to confidently support students pursuing studies in Germany.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Secure your spot on the webinar to guide your students to destination Germany!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
