<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Help Students Stay Safe </span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">from Payment Scams</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">Scammers are getting smarter—mimicking real providers and offering “faster” payment promises that often hide risky, unverified channels.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;"><strong>Your Role Has Never Been More Important</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">As a trusted education agent, you’re on the front line of student safety. That’s why Flywire created a <strong>free Student Payment Safety Toolkit, </strong>so you can educate and empower students to stay protected.&nbsp;Now available in both <strong>English</strong> and <strong>Chinese</strong>, this toolkit is easy to share with students and families in the language they’re most comfortable with.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>What You Can Share with Students</strong></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">6 Quick Steps to Safer Payments</span>: Simple actions students can take to protect their tuition.</span></li> 
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Online Safety Tips:</span> How to safeguard personal and financial info.</span></li> 
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Spot &amp; Report Red Flags</span>: What scams look like and what to do next.</span></li> 
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Why Official Channels Matter:</span><span style="background-color: transparent;"> How trusted providers like Flywire ensure security.</span></li> 
<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Interactive Scam Quiz</span><span style="background-color: transparent;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">:</span> A fun way for students to test their awareness.</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Access the Toolkit in English or Chinese:</strong></span><br />Help protect student finances, build family trust, and reinforce your reputation as a safe, reliable partner.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
