<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">From Empty Nest to Full Confidence:</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">A Guide to Secure Payments</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">In Flywire's newest video from our '<a style="color: #223341;" href="https://vimeo.com/1093879994?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q2-2025"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Empty Nest</u></strong></span></a>' series, which feature famous Bollywood star <strong>Varun Badola</strong>, we highlight exactly why parents and agents worldwide choose us. See how we ensure your payments are always quick, transparent, and safe, giving you and your clients confidence at every step of their educational journey.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-507-82" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><a href="https://vimeo.com/1093879994?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q2-2025" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9v0ru8dw6f/en_us/images/685a0f4d2d180-1750732621.1847.png" alt="Flywire 'Empty Nest' video on quick, transparent, and safe international tuition payments." title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
</tr> 
