<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Flywire China’s Labubu Campaign:</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">A Viral Hit with Education Agents</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">From <strong>May 19–31</strong>, Flywire’s China team successfully executed an innovative <strong>Labubu-themed incentive campaign</strong> tailored for education agents; the first of its kind in the international education industry in China. By leveraging the viral appeal of this cultural trend, the campaign drove remarkable results: <strong>177+ participating agents</strong> within just 12 days.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Congratulations to all the winners!</strong> Eighteen agent counsellors received exclusive Labubu collectibles as rewards, adding an extra layer of excitement and motivation.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">The campaign’s success showcased Flywire’s ability to deliver culturally relevant, performance-driven marketing and even sparked similar initiatives across the education sector in China. It’s a great reminder of how creative, localised campaigns can set new standards and inspire broader industry engagement.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-507-82" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9v0ru8dw6f/en_us/images/685b7c3957808-1750826041.3585.jpg" alt="image" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
