<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Connecting with Consultants at the SACA Annual Meet</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We were excited to take part in the Study Abroad Consultants Association (SACA) Annual Meet on June 8th, 2025, in Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh — a fantastic opportunity to connect with many of you in person!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">With over 150 education consultants in attendance, the event was a great platform to share how Flywire continues to support our agent partners with secure, transparent, and compliant international payment solutions that make life easier for both you and your students.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">A big thank you to everyone who stopped by to chat with our team — we always appreciate hearing your feedback and ideas. We're excited to build on our success and bring you even more value.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-507-82" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9v0ru8dw6f/en_us/images/685b566480972-1750816356.5267.png" alt="image" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
