<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Help Us Understand</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Student Trends to the USA</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">With USA visa policies shifting, many students are re-evaluating their study abroad plans. We want to hear from you! What are your students saying about the US as a destination, and what’s driving their decisions?</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Take 2 minutes to complete our <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/DKWCPGG?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q2-2025"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>quick survey </u></strong></span></a>and help us tailor our tools and support to better serve you. <span style="color: #223341;">Bonus: You’ll be entered <strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">into a draw to win a $200 Amazon gift card!</span></strong></span></span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
